OL,3,GNEWSABuilding site 'crush' not captured
OL,4,Aon CCTV - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe moment a delivery driver was
OL,7,Ffatally injured on a building site was
OL,8,Fnot captured on CCTV, an inquest has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FNigel Williamson had been delivering
OL,12,Flarge bags of gravel to the Kneeton
OL,13,FGrove housing development in East
OL,14,FBridgford using a crane-mounted lorry
OL,15,Fwhen he died last August.
OL,17,FThe 60-year-old, who had worked for KRM
OL,18,FBuilding Supplies, was found the lying
OL,19,Fin the flatbed of the lorry in pain,
OL,20,Fand said the words "crushed and crane",
OL,21,Fbefore he suffered a cardiac arrest,
OL,22,Fwitnesses said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
