OL,3,GNEWSABuilding site 'crush' not captured
OL,4,Aon CCTV - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest at Nottingham Coroner's
OL,7,FCourt on Wednesday heard a remote
OL,8,Fcontrol for the crane, which had been
OL,9,Faround Williamson's body before he was
OL,10,Finjured, was later found strapped to
OL,11,Fthe machine.
